  "summary": "Preinstall DNS beacon to Interactsh OOB host (dependency-confusion recon)",
  "details": "On npm install, the package's preinstall hook executes index.js which performs a DNS lookup for a unique subdomain of oast.fun (ojoecyzdevxakimabqtr9bimrjqhw66z.oast.fun), a public Interactsh out-of-band callback service. Resolution of that unique subdomain confirms to the publisher that code executed on the installer's host and leaks the resolver IP and reachability. The package has empty/placeholder author and description metadata and a name shape consistent with a dependency-confusion squat against a private internal package.",
